{
  "_id": "index-weapon",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Nephites make weapons of war, Jarom 1:8. Zeniff arms his people with weapons, Mosiah 9:16. Nephites arm themselves with weapons of war, Alma 2:12 (43:18; 60:2). converted Lamanites lay down weapons of rebellion, Alma 23:7 (Hel. 5:51). people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi bury weapons, Alma 24:17–19 (26:32; 53:11–16; 56:6–7; Hel. 15:9). other Lamanites throw down weapons and are converted, Alma 24:25–26 (25:14). soldiers of Zerahemnah throw down weapons, Alma 44:14–15. dissenters who lift weapons against Nephite army are hewn down, Alma 51:18–19. Nephites fall upon Lamanites who do not give up their weapons, Alma 52:25, 32. sons of Ammonites take up weapons to support Nephites, Alma 53:16–19. Lamanite prisoners enter covenant not to take up weapons against Nephites, Alma 62:16. no weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper, 3 Ne. 22:17 (Isa. 54:17). Lamanites fall upon Nephites with all manner of weapons, Morm. 6:7–9. people must lay down weapons and delight no more in bloodshed, Morm. 7:4. Jaredites make all manner of weapons of war, Ether 10:27.",
